	abstract = {When and how to come out are difficult choices.  In this research project, we examine one form of disclosure: the addition of an LGBTQ keyword to one's online social media profile.  We construct daily time series of the prevalence of LGBTQ keywords within American Twitter users' self-descriptions.  Further, we construct daily time series of inferred add and drop events.  These we compare to relevant annual and one-time events.  We confirm or disconfirm our pre-registered hypotheses.},
